OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers will
OL,6,Ftend to die away from the east during
OL,7,Fthe evening to leave a largely dry
OL,8,Fnight with clear spells appearing most
OL,9,Freadily in the east.
OL,10,
OL,11,CWednesday:FWindy. Most staying dry
OL,12,Fthrough to mid-afternoon with some
OL,13,Flimited early brightness. Patchy rain
OL,14,Ffeeding from the west late afternoon
OL,15,Fto early evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
